{
  "bodyHash": "+TMAg9HR/Xk=",
  "content": "<h3><span style=\"color:#f0f\">MOA DECOR: 假日系列</span></h3><p><em>這是一款裝飾模組，旨在為你的建築增添新的節日主題物件。目前已經有許多家具模組，而本模組旨在成為它們的補充，因為你可以找到數百種不同的物件和元素來裝飾你的世界。作為&nbsp;</em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><em>MOA DECOR</em><em>&nbsp;系列</em></strong></span><em>的其中一個模組。</em></p><p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/739/184/moa-festivo12.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1466\" height=\"749\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3><span style=\"color:#f0f\">合成方式</span></h3><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/739/172/c-festivo-1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"475\" height=\"228\"></p><p><span style=\"color:#000\">模組中的所有物品皆可在生存模式中獲得。要開始製作這些物件，你必須在合成台上放置一個<strong>洋紅色</strong>染料和一顆綠寶石，這樣你就能獲得<strong>&nbsp;9 顆假日寶石</strong>。透過將它們與其他材料結合，你就能獲得裝飾物品。<strong>&nbsp;共有 150 種不同的物品！</strong></span></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/739/173/c-festivo-2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"475\" height=\"227\"></p><p><strong>範例：</strong> 如果你想獲得一個騎著掃帚的女巫模型，其合成配方中必須包含一顆假日寶石，以及該物件的額外材料。在此情況下，額外材料為一個鍋釜、一顆綠寶石、一根木棍和小麥。還有一些次要的合成配方來自兩個模型的物件組合。在這些情況下，則不需要假日寶石，因為在先前的合成中已經使用過了。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/739/174/moa-festivo1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1466\" height=\"452\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/739/175/moa-festivo2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1466\" height=\"451\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/739/176/moa-festivo3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1466\" height=\"569\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/739/177/moa-festivo4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1466\" height=\"465\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/739/178/moa-festivo5.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1466\" height=\"428\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/739/179/moa-festivo6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1466\" height=\"505\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/739/180/moa-festivo7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1466\" height=\"554\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/739/181/moa-festivo8.png\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/739/183/moa-festivo11.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1466\" height=\"765\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/739/185/moa-festivo13.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1005\" height=\"867\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/739/182/moa-festivo10.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1291\" height=\"958\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/739/186/moa-festivo14.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"835\" height=\"948\"></p><h2><em><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong><u>注意：</u></strong></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">為了獲得更加完整的體驗，建議查看&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>MOA DECOR</strong>&nbsp;<strong>系列</strong></span>中的其他模組，其中有更多能與本模組相輔相成的分類。</span></em></h2><p><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moa-decor-cookery\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/636/472/638039093834758638.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moa-decor-art\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/636/441/638039045898196915.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moa-decor-science\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/636/488/638039109952819535.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moa-decor-toys\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/636/495/638039124454094910.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moa-decor-bath\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/808/248/638178193015946116.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moa-decor-lights\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/853/442/638257035280816288.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moa-decor-garden\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/872/565/638291506409003759.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moa-decor-holidays\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/885/795/638321626215674397.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a></p>",
